OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 2 JUN
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GSoweto presents an hour of
OL,12,     Gexciting new releases and jazz
OL,13,     Gclassics, and Huw Marc Bennett is
OL,14,     Gback to share another artist that
OL,15,     Ghe is influenced by, for Flowers.
OL,16,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,17,     GBaritone Samuel Hasselhorn and
OL,18,     Gpianist Julius Drake perform
OL,19,     Gworks by Clara and Robert
OL,20,     GSchumann, celebrating Schumann's
OL,21,     Gpoets. Penny Gore presents.
